{"seq":2,"slug":"coverage-guided-fuzzing","title":"覆盖率引导模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/coverage-guided-fuzzing","wordCount":1546,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"覆盖率引导模糊测试\">覆盖率引导模糊测试</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>覆盖率引导模糊测试（CGF）将代码覆盖率作为反馈信号引导输入变异——任何触发新代码路径的输入被加入语料库作为后续变异基础，形成正反馈的进化循环。关键实现包括 AFL 的边覆盖位图、LibFuzzer 的进程内模型、Go 原生 fuzzing 的标准化 API。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖率引导的核心反馈循环\">覆盖率引导的核心反馈循环</h2><p>覆盖率引导模糊测试（Coverage-Guided Fuzzing, CGF）是现代灰盒模糊器的技术核心。其革命性创新在于将代码覆盖率作为<em>反馈信号</em>来引导输入变异的方向——任何触发新代码路径的输入都被视为&quot;有趣的&quot;（interesting），加入语料库作为后续变异的基础。</p>\n<p>这形成了一个进化式反馈循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[种子语料库] --&gt; B[选择种子]&#10;    B --&gt; C[变异生成新输入]&#10;    C --&gt; D[执行被测程序]&#10;    D --&gt; E[收集覆盖率信息]&#10;    E --&gt; F{触发新覆盖?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[加入语料库]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[丢弃]&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    H --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt; I{触发崩溃?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[保存崩溃输入]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| E\">flowchart TD\n    A[种子语料库] --&gt; B[选择种子]\n    B --&gt; C[变异生成新输入]\n    C --&gt; D[执行被测程序]\n    D --&gt; E[收集覆盖率信息]\n    E --&gt; F{触发新覆盖?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[加入语料库]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[丢弃]\n    G --&gt; B\n    H --&gt; B\n    D --&gt; I{触发崩溃?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[保存崩溃输入]\n    I --&gt;|否| E</pre><p>这个循环的关键性质：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>正反馈</strong>：新覆盖 → 新种子 → 更多新覆盖，形成覆盖率的单调增长</li>\n<li><strong>遗传记忆</strong>：有趣输入被保留，变异在&quot;好基因&quot;上进行，类似进化算法</li>\n<li><strong>隐式优先级</strong>：能触发新路径的变异方向被自动优先探索</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖率度量的实现机制\">覆盖率度量的实现机制</h2><p>覆盖率信息的收集通过编译时插桩实现。主流方法有两种：</p>\n<p><strong>边覆盖（Edge Coverage）</strong>——AFL 的方法：</p>\n<p>在每个基本块的入口插入代码，记录从上一个基本块到当前基本块的转换（即控制流图中的<em>边</em>）。这比纯行覆盖提供更丰富的信息：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>edge_id</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>prev_block</mtext><mo>⊕</mo><mtext>curr_block</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>MAP_SIZE</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{edge\\_id} = (\\text{prev\\_block} \\oplus \\text{curr\\_block}) \\mod \\text{MAP\\_SIZE}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">edge_id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prev_block</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">curr_block</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace allowbreak\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAP_SIZE</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>AFL 使用一个 64KB 的共享内存位图（bitmap）来记录边的命中计数。命中计数被桶化（bucketed）为 8 个级别：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo><mn>15</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo><mn>31</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>32</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo><mn>127</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>128</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{1, 2, 3, 4{-}7, 8{-}15, 16{-}31, 32{-}127, 128{+}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span><span class=\"mord\">31</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span><span class=\"mord\">127</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着从&quot;执行 3 次&quot;变成&quot;执行 5 次&quot;会被视为新覆盖。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>桶编号</th>\n<th>命中计数范围</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>从未执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>执行恰好 1 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>执行 2 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>执行 3 次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4-7</td>\n<td>执行少量次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>8-15</td>\n<td>执行中等次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>16-31</td>\n<td>执行较多次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>32-127</td>\n<td>执行很多次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>128+</td>\n<td>大量执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>PC 表覆盖（SanitizerCoverage）</strong>——LibFuzzer 的方法：</p>\n<p>LLVM 的 SanitizerCoverage 提供多层覆盖粒度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 编译器在每个边插入回调&#10;void __sanitizer_cov_trace_pc_guard(uint32_t *guard) {&#10;    if (!*guard) return;  // 已知边，跳过&#10;    *guard = 0;           // 标记为已覆盖&#10;    // 记录新覆盖&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译器在每个边插入回调</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> __sanitizer_cov_trace_pc_guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">guard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">guard) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 已知边，跳过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">guard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 标记为已覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 记录新覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>高级功能还包括值追踪（value profiling）——比较指令的参数值变化也被视为覆盖信号：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 启用值追踪&#10;./fuzzer -use_value_profile=1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启用值追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./fuzzer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -use_value_profile=1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这帮助模糊器突破&quot;魔术数字&quot;比较（magic byte comparisons）——传统覆盖率引导难以通过随机变异满足 <code>if (input == 0xDEADBEEF)</code> 这类检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"afl-的工作流详解\">AFL 的工作流详解</h2><p>American Fuzzy Lop（AFL）由 Michał Zalewski 于 2013 年开发，是覆盖率引导模糊测试的先驱实现。其工作流可分解为以下阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>1. 编译时插桩</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 afl-gcc/afl-clang-fast 编译&#10;afl-clang-fast -g -O2 -fsanitize=address target.c -o target\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 afl-gcc/afl-clang-fast 编译</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">afl-clang-fast</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -fsanitize=address</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target.c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2. 确定性变异阶段</strong>（Deterministic Stage）：</p>\n<p>对每个种子按顺序施加确定性变异——位翻转、字节翻转、算术增减、有趣值替换。这一阶段的目标是系统性地探索每个字节的影响。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 随机变异阶段</strong>（Havoc Stage）：</p>\n<p>多个变异操作的随机组合——叠加多种变异产生更激进的输入变体。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 拼接阶段</strong>（Splice Stage）：</p>\n<p>将两个不同种子在随机位置拼接，组合两个输入的&quot;好基因&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 功率调度</strong>（Power Scheduling）：</p>\n<p>为每个种子分配变异次数（energy）。AFL++ 引入了多种调度策略——执行速度快、覆盖新边多的种子获得更多 energy。</p>\n<h2 id=\"go-原生模糊测试\">Go 原生模糊测试</h2><p>Go 1.18（2022 年 3 月）将模糊测试作为标准库的一等公民引入。其设计理念是&quot;最低摩擦&quot;——开发者只需编写一个 <code>FuzzXxx</code> 函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func FuzzParseJSON(f *testing.F) {&#10;    // 种子语料库&#10;    f.Add([]byte(`{&quot;key&quot;: &quot;value&quot;}`))&#10;    f.Add([]byte(`[1, 2, 3]`))&#10;    f.Add([]byte(`null`))&#10;&#10;    // 模糊目标&#10;    f.Fuzz(func(t *testing.T, data []byte) {&#10;        var result interface{}&#10;        if err := json.Unmarshal(data, &amp;result); err != nil {&#10;            return // 解析错误是预期的&#10;        }&#10;        // 往返性检查&#10;        encoded, err := json.Marshal(result)&#10;        if err != nil {&#10;            t.Fatalf(&quot;Marshal failed: %v&quot;, err)&#10;        }&#10;        var roundtrip interface{}&#10;        if err := json.Unmarshal(encoded, &amp;roundtrip); err != nil {&#10;            t.Fatalf(&quot;Roundtrip unmarshal failed: %v&quot;, err)&#10;        }&#10;    })&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FuzzParseJSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">F</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 种子语料库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`{\"key\": \"value\"}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`[1, 2, 3]`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`null`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 模糊目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Fuzz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">testing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">byte</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unmarshal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 解析错误是预期的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 往返性检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        encoded, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Marshal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            t.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Fatalf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Marshal failed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> roundtrip </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Unmarshal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(encoded, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">roundtrip); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            t.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Fatalf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Roundtrip unmarshal failed: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Go fuzzing 的特点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准化 API</td>\n<td>使用 <code>testing.F</code>，与 <code>testing.T</code> 一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率引导</td>\n<td>内置覆盖率插桩，自动保存有趣输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语料库管理</td>\n<td>自动存储在 <code>testdata/fuzz/</code> 目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持的类型</td>\n<td><code>string</code>, <code>[]byte</code>, 整数类型, <code>float32/64</code>, <code>bool</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行执行</td>\n<td>多 worker 并行模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回归测试</td>\n<td>发现的输入自动成为回归测试用例</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年 Trail of Bits 发布的 <strong>gosentry</strong> 项目将 Go 的 <code>testing.F</code> 接口与 LibAFL 引擎结合，支持结构感知模糊、语法驱动模糊和更多 bug 类检测（goroutine 泄漏、数据竞争、整数溢出）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"libfuzzer-的进程内模型\">LibFuzzer 的进程内模型</h2><p>LibFuzzer 是 LLVM 项目的组成部分，采用<strong>进程内</strong>（in-process）执行模型——模糊目标函数在模糊器进程内反复调用，避免了 fork 开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 模糊目标接口&#10;extern &quot;C&quot; int LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput(const uint8_t *Data, size_t Size) {&#10;    // 对 Data 做有趣的事情&#10;    ParseInput(Data, Size);&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 模糊目标接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extern</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">size_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 对 Data 做有趣的事情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    ParseInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Data, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>进程内模型的优势是执行速度极快（10 万+ 次/秒），劣势是目标崩溃会终止整个模糊器进程（通过 fork 模式或异常处理缓解）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年灰盒模糊器的性能基准\">2026 年灰盒模糊器的性能基准</h2><p>2026 年 SecDev 会议上 Frolikov 的独立评估论文《Reality Check》对 6 个现代灰盒模糊器做了系统性基准测试：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模糊器</th>\n<th>平均性能（% of maximum）</th>\n<th>关键特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AFL++</td>\n<td>97%</td>\n<td>增强变异算子，功率调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LibAFL</td>\n<td>97%</td>\n<td>Rust 实现，模块化架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCSF</td>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td>预测性上下文敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AFL (baseline)</td>\n<td>93%</td>\n<td>原始 AFL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Darwin</td>\n<td>92%</td>\n<td>机器学习引导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MOPT</td>\n<td>92%</td>\n<td>变异算子优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EcoFuzz</td>\n<td>88%</td>\n<td>能量节约策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键发现：模糊器性能高度依赖目标特性——复杂目标上不同模糊器的性能差距可达 37 个百分点，而简单目标趋于收敛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>覆盖率引导模糊测试通过&quot;新路径=有趣&quot;的反馈信号将随机变异升级为定向探索。AFL 的边覆盖位图和命中计数桶化、LibFuzzer 的进程内高速执行、Go 1.18 的零摩擦集成、gosentry 的 LibAFL 增强引擎代表了该领域的不同权衡点。2026 年独立基准测试表明 AFL++ 和 LibAFL 以 97% 的性能领跑，但性能高度依赖目标特性。工程实践中，覆盖率引导对字节流输入效果最佳；结构化输入需要进一步的技术支撑。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>sibling-link</strong>: 覆盖率引导解决了&quot;朝哪探索&quot;的问题；但对有复杂格式约束的输入（协议、语法），纯字节变异效率极低。见 <a href=\"structured-fuzzing\">结构化模糊测试</a> 了解如何为结构化输入构建高效模糊策略。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"覆盖率引导模糊测试","id":"覆盖率引导模糊测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖率引导的核心反馈循环","id":"覆盖率引导的核心反馈循环"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖率度量的实现机制","id":"覆盖率度量的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"AFL 的工作流详解","id":"afl-的工作流详解"},{"level":2,"text":"Go 原生模糊测试","id":"go-原生模糊测试"},{"level":2,"text":"LibFuzzer 的进程内模型","id":"libfuzzer-的进程内模型"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年灰盒模糊器的性能基准","id":"2026-年灰盒模糊器的性能基准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模糊测试基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/fuzzing-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"结构化模糊测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/property-based-testing/fuzzing/structured-fuzzing"}}